{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmh0avm2eko0","created":1793245007350,"text":"神经网络"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0bbf5qlc0","created":1793245041761,"text":"神经元模型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0dkg19pc0","created":1793245218133,"text":"M-P神经元模型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0e68csmo0","created":1793245265558,"text":"人工神经网络最基础单元。接收多个输入，每个输入带连接权重，将加权求和结果减去阈值，送入激活函数得到输出。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0dnw2ag80","created":1793245225633,"text":"两类激活函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0dwus9yw0","created":1793245245146,"text":"阶跃函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0egf8xzc0","created":1793245287743,"text":"输出 0/1，代表抑制 / 兴奋；缺点：不连续、不可导，无法用于梯度优化。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0e1eg7og0","created":1793245255043,"text":"Sigmoid函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0ekcd8rs0","created":1793245296276,"text":"把实数映射到(0,1)，连续光滑可导，也叫挤压函数。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0ds0j97k0","created":1793245234610,"text":"神经网络"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0enf2x4w0","created":1793245302970,"text":"大量神经元按照一定层次互连组成，本质是带大量参数的复合数学函数。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0bf4dkcg0","created":1793245049816,"text":"感知机与多层网络"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0esv2vq80","created":1793245314821,"text":"感知机"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0ewuvtv40","created":1793245323517,"text":"两层神经元（输入层+输出层M-P神经元），只有输出层是功能神经元。 可以实现线性可分的逻辑运算：与、或、非。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0f5uva400","created":1793245343107,"text":"局限"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0fdvtlrc0","created":1793245360579,"text":"只能处理线性可分问题，无法解决异或（XOR）这类非线性可分问题；线性不可分数据集上训练会震荡，无法收敛。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0fj66qrk0","created":1793245372089,"text":"多层前馈神经网络"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0ftpk6u00","created":1793245395029,"text":"增加隐含层（隐层），隐层、输出层都是带激活函数的功能神经元，输入层只做信号接收，不做计算。只要含有至少一个隐层，就是多层网络。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0fprhxew0","created":1793245386438,"text":"结构特点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0fy661ts0","created":1793245404740,"text":"层间全连接，无同层连接、无跨层连接、无环路。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0g3cfdko0","created":1793245416002,"text":"单隐层网络"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0g6gry8w0","created":1793245422795,"text":"输入层 + 1个隐层 + 输出层，可以拟合任意复杂连续函数。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0bja8fjs0","created":1793245058877,"text":" 误差逆传播算法（BP算法）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0go3m4tk0","created":1793245461182,"text":"定义"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0grn19wo0","created":1793245468886,"text":"训练多层前馈网络最经典算法，基于梯度下降；BP网络一般指BP算法训练的多层前馈网络。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0qv2m6x40","created":1793246260000,"text":"目标"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0qzabink0","created":1793246269173,"text":"最小化每个样本的均方误差"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0r6qnm9s0","created":1793246285399,"text":"核心思想：误差反向传播","font-weight":"bold"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0rgfcq740","created":1793246306483,"text":"前向传播：输入样本，逐层计算，得到网络预测输出；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0rixnbg00","created":1793246311943,"text":"计算输出层误差；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0rm7d8i80","created":1793246319061,"text":"将输出误差逆向传播回隐层，计算隐层神经元误差；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0roij25c0","created":1793246324089,"text":"梯度下降更新所有权重与阈值； "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0rr08kgo0","created":1793246329514,"text":"迭代直到满足停止条件。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0ry1vt600","created":1793246344851,"text":"两种训练策略"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0s2r3i5s0","created":1793246355082,"text":"标准BP算法（单样本BP）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0shlgoaw0","created":1793246387393,"text":"每输入一个样本就更新参数；更新频繁，样本带来的梯度震荡。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0s6gc8q80","created":1793246363139,"text":"累积BP算法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0sczfsnc0","created":1793246377355,"text":"读完全部训练集，累积全部样本总误差之后再更新一次参数；梯度更稳定，但收敛慢。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0sv3rmso0","created":1793246416798,"text":"过拟合缓解手段"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0t1u62k00","created":1793246431455,"text":"早停"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0t7afc4w0","created":1793246443322,"text":"划分训练集、验证集；训练集误差下降、验证集误差上升时停止训练。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0t4o0i1k0","created":1793246437614,"text":"正则化"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0ta0ok4g0","created":1793246449264,"text":"损失函数增加权重衰减项，惩罚过大权重。"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0dawbxuw0","created":1793245197351,"text":"全局最小与局部极小"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0tfv23bs0","created":1793246461984,"text":"局部极小"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0tmnlpsw0","created":1793246476771,"text":"参数空间某一点，周围所有点误差都更大"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0tighr080","created":1793246467634,"text":"全局最小"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0tpzjsq80","created":1793246484024,"text":"整个参数空间误差最小点。 "},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0twbu6co0","created":1793246497827,"text":"区分"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0tz61eaw0","created":1793246504007,"text":"“全局最小” 是最优解；“局部极小” 只是局部范围内最优；停止迭代时也可能落在平坦的 “鞍点”。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0ddvnt2g0","created":1793245203840,"text":"其他常见神经网络"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0u31lvns0","created":1793246512446,"text":"RBF径向基网络"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0ulucvds0","created":1793246553367,"text":"单隐层前馈网络；隐层使用径向基函数，输出层线性；原理依靠样本与中心点距离，理论上可以逼近任意连续函数。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0u95x2l40","created":1793246525768,"text":"ART自适应共振理论"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0ubrtwl40","created":1793246531446,"text":"SOM自组织映射"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0uenigvs0","created":1793246537715,"text":"级联相关网络"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0uhq4kv40","created":1793246544404,"text":"Elman递归神经网络（RNN）"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}